    "API key": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API key"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "API key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Pencil 直接用上面的工具，手指照常滚动和选字。再点一次当前工具可以放下它。没有笔时，可以在设置里让手指也能用工具。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Pencil uses the tools above; your finger still scrolls and selects text. Tap the current tool again to put it down. Without a Pencil, you can let your finger use the tools in Settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Apple Pencil 直接用上面的工具，手指照常滚动和选字。再点一次当前工具可以放下它。没有笔时，可以在设置里让手指也能用工具。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Key 只保存在这台设备的钥匙串里。用 AI 时，选中的原文、前后几段文字、书名和你的问题会直接发给服务商，不经过任何中间服务器；第一次发送前会先问你，关掉后下次用 AI 时会再问。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your key stays in this device's Keychain. When you use AI, the selected passage, the paragraphs around it, the book title and your question go straight to the service, with no server in between. Ginkgo asks before the first request; turn this off and it asks again next time."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Key 只保存在这台设备的钥匙串里。用 AI 时，选中的原文、前后几段文字、书名和你的问题会直接发给服务商，不经过任何中间服务器；第一次发送前会先问你，关掉后下次用 AI 时会再问。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
