    "书、划线、批注、笔迹、草稿和阅读位置保存在你自己的 iCloud 里，登录同一个 Apple 账户的设备都能看到。PDF 文件放在 iCloud 云盘里，不会出现在「文件」App 中。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Books, marks, notes, handwriting, scratch sheets and reading positions are kept in your own iCloud, so every device signed in to the same Apple Account sees them. PDF files live in iCloud Drive and don't appear in the Files app."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "书、划线、批注、笔迹、草稿和阅读位置保存在你自己的 iCloud 里，登录同一个 Apple 账户的设备都能看到。PDF 文件放在 iCloud 云盘里，不会出现在「文件」App 中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
