    "单指直接用上面的工具，双指滚动和缩放。再点一次当前工具可以放下它，回到选字。在设置里可以改成只用 Apple Pencil。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One finger uses the tools above; two fingers scroll and zoom. Tap the current tool again to put it down and select text. You can switch to Apple Pencil only in Settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "单指直接用上面的工具，双指滚动和缩放。再点一次当前工具可以放下它，回到选字。在设置里可以改成只用 Apple Pencil。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
