    "用手指画": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drawing with fingers"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用手指画"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用手指画：跟随系统时，用过 Apple Pencil 就只有笔能画，手指滚动和选字；没有笔的 iPad 用手指画，双指滚动。拿起工具时，双指轻点页面撤销上一步。系统手势始终可用：三指左滑撤销，三指右滑重做，三指轻点弹出编辑栏；接键盘时用 ⌘Z 和 ⇧⌘Z。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drawing with fingers: following the system, once you've used Apple Pencil only the Pencil draws and fingers scroll and select; on an iPad without a Pencil, fingers draw and two fingers scroll. With a tool picked up, a two-finger tap undoes the last step. System gestures always work: three-finger swipe left to undo, right to redo, three-finger tap for the edit bar; with a keyboard, ⌘Z and ⇧⌘Z."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用手指画：跟随系统时，用过 Apple Pencil 就只有笔能画，手指滚动和选字；没有笔的 iPad 用手指画，双指滚动。拿起工具时，双指轻点页面撤销上一步。系统手势始终可用：三指左滑撤销，三指右滑重做，三指轻点弹出编辑栏；接键盘时用 ⌘Z 和 ⇧⌘Z。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
