    "翻译": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Translate"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "翻译"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "翻译外语时，选一个词出词卡，选一句话出译文和重点表达，难句可以再要语法分析。挑哪些表达、讲多深，按你的外语水平来。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When translating another language, a word gets a dictionary card and a sentence gets a translation with key expressions; hard sentences can also get a grammar walk-through. What's picked out, and how deep it goes, follows your language level."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "翻译外语时，选一个词出词卡，选一句话出译文和重点表达，难句可以再要语法分析。挑哪些表达、讲多深，按你的外语水平来。"
          }
        }
      }
